/*.sdfg

# Serialized SDFGs are build output, never repo content -- including under tests/, which
# used to be excepted here. A .sdfgz is a compressed JSON snapshot of an internal schema, so
# a committed one silently rots as the schema moves and then pins nothing: the five removed
# here had 51 LoopRegions whose start_block index was out of range for their own node list,
# and no longer deserialized at all. Build fixtures from source instead.
# (doc/_static/sdfg/*.sdfg are hand-maintained documentation assets and stay tracked.)
*.sdfgz
/*.sdfgz
/*.sdfg


.DS_STORE
.DS_Store


.*cache/
/doc/source/config_schema.rst

